        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Iron sulphate, at plant
Iron sulphate is a by-product of steel and iron manufacturing.;
CAS number: 007720-78-7; 
Formula: FeSO4; 
UUID: 1b541649-c28b-369b-a574-066c98648887
Rough estimation of the electricity use for purification of the by-product. No data for infrastructure and emissions
Location: Investigation for CH.
Technology: Chemical product for waste water treatment.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Diploma thesis for a waste water treatment plant. 
Extrapolations: From single data to European situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1b541649-c28b-369b-a574-066c98648887.xml</text>
